{'symbol': 'GLW', 'date': '2022-06-29 13:54:00', 'title': 'CORNING ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': "CORNING, N.Y., JUNE 29, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- CORNING INCORPORATED'S (NYSE: GLW) BOARD OF DIRECTORS TODAY DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.27 PER SHARE ON THE COMPANY'S COMMON STOCK. THE DIVIDEND WILL BE PAYABLE ON SEPT. 29, 2022, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON AUG. 31, 2022."}